                                <img alt="The Teller Window" src="/medialibrary/media/images/v4/about_the_fed/the-teller-window-mm-b-280x176.png" width="144" height="88">
                                <p>The Teller Window is a publication featuring expert knowledge and insight from the New York Fed, including thoughts and perspectives from senior leaders.</p>
                            </a>
